WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:01,340
This is also his year

2
00:00:01,340 --> 00:00:02,740
The fifth solo concert

3
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:04,340
But it’s the first one in the East China Sea

4
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:06,130
He is very busy recently

5
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:07,330
It’s concert rehearsal again

6
00:00:07,330 --> 00:00:08,530
Another new movie promotion

7
00:00:08,530 --> 00:00:09,730
It's really hard for him

8
00:00:09,730 --> 00:00:10,730
Taking some time to rehearse

9
00:00:10,730 --> 00:00:11,930
Came here specially to see me

10
00:00:11,930 --> 00:00:13,130
It turned out to be a concert

11
00:00:13,130 --> 00:00:14,130
I don't quite understand this

12
00:00:14,130 --> 00:00:15,130
I won't go

13
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:16,330
Don't tell me this

14
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:18,130
Just tell him directly that he asked you to go

15
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:21,530
It's not like I asked you to go, I told you, don't really get the advantage and still be good.

16
00:00:21,530 --> 00:00:22,930
What he got was a VIP ticket.

17
00:00:22,930 --> 00:00:24,330
Sitting in the VIP seats at the front

18
00:00:24,330 --> 00:00:26,730
This ticket can be sold for thousands. This kind of ticket is sold privately.

19
00:00:26,730 --> 00:00:28,330
One ticket can fetch tens of thousands

20
00:00:28,530 --> 00:00:30,780
Don’t think it’s easy to get this ticket either.

21
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:32,380
Although it is his concert

22
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:33,980
But there is an economic company behind him

23
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:35,980
Holding a concert also involves the performance company

24
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:37,180
He doesn't have the final say on the votes

25
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:38,780
The tickets for his concert have long been sold out

26
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:39,780
Hard to get a vote

27
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:41,380
What's more, this kind of VIP ticket

28
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:42,380
He's going to get you one

29
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:43,580
You have to think of many ways

30
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,380
If he gets you a ticket, you won't go

31
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:46,780
With his character, he will definitely kill you.

32
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:48,180
Don't blame me for not reminding you then

33
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:49,180
Then I'd better go

34
00:00:49,180 --> 00:00:50,980
And if you want to go, I have to go too.

35
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:51,980
Body temperature is normal

36
00:00:51,980 --> 00:00:52,980
The situation is also stable

37
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:54,620
You can go home and rest

38
00:00:54,620 --> 00:00:56,220
Then I can go to the company tomorrow

39
00:00:56,220 --> 00:00:58,220
Now you have two days of rest at home. Don’t rush to work.

40
00:00:58,220 --> 00:01:00,020
Get the doctor's note early in the morning

41
00:01:00,020 --> 00:01:01,220
Take good care of your body first

42
00:01:01,220 --> 00:01:03,020
You arranged it for me instead

43
00:01:03,020 --> 00:01:04,020
The clothes are here

44
00:01:04,020 --> 00:01:13,210
I'll wait at the door

45
00:01:13,210 --> 00:01:14,810
It's quite a rule. Let's go.

46
00:01:14,810 --> 00:01:16,210
Slow down, don't be in a hurry
